~ start
#								relative pos		zoom 	time	trans	ease type
#do! CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(750.0, -100.0), 0.5, 3, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")

#							name 	x destination, speed, animate, moonwalk
#do! CutsceneManager.npc_move("Az", 500.0, 		200.0,	 100.0, false, false)
do! CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(-15000,3200), 0.5, 2, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
Fenn: Whoa! Are you [color="red"]Az[/color]? [wave freq=7 amp=30][color="red"]Az Featherstone[/color][/wave]?
Az: Yeah- [wait=0.2]Wait, what?
Fenn: [speed=2]The great blacksmith apprentice and [/speed][speed=2.5]daughter of the incredible Knight of Smithing, [wave freq=7 amp=30][color="red"]Abdullah Featherstone[/color]?[/wave][/speed]
do EventBus.interrupt_dialogue.emit("0.2")
Fenn: [speed=2]Oh by Post! This is really happening. [/speed][speed=2.5]What is he like? [color="red"]Abdul[/color]? Is he cool? I bet he's really cool. What's the coolest thing he's made? Is it-[/speed]
Az: [i]cough[/i] Slow down, kid. What's your name?
Fenn: Fenn!
Az: Okay,[wait=0.2] Fenn.[wait=0.2] Love the enthusiasm, but I'm kinda busy right now. 
Az: My [color="red"]Baba[/color] is trapped in the Council Chamber, and I saw one of those "[color="purple"]Wizards[/color]" escape into the Cellar.
Fenn: [font_size=60]Really?!?![wait=0.2] [shake level=10 rate=50 connected=0]ADVENTURE AWAITS!![/shake][/font_size]
Az: Absolutely not, kid. Adventure can wait a little longer.
Az: Stay [i]here.[/i]
do EventBus.interrupt_dialogue.emit("0.2")
Fenn: [speed=1]Wait, wait, wait. [/speed][speed=1.5]Are you gonna breathe fire? [/speed][speed=2]I know [color="red"]Adbul[/color] can breathe fire. That's so cool. I wish I could breathe fire. Are-[/speed]
Az: OKAY! Okay. Listen, I need to go grab something. I'll be back soon. Will you stay here?
Fenn: Hm... no promises.
Az: [i]cough[/i] Seriously?
Fenn: Yup!
Az: [shake level=7 rate=20 connected=0]Ugh[/shake]. Whatever.
do CutsceneManager.npc_move("Az", -16128, 250, false, false)
do CutsceneManager.remove_npc("Az")
#do CutsceneManager._end_cutscene()
do EventFlags.set_flag("Az-Meet-GreatHall", true)
=> END